12PROSECUTION WITNESSES 13In order to prove its case, the prosecution has examined as many as nine witnesses i.e. ASI Surat Singh, the duty officer who has recorded the formal FIR in the case,
has been examined as PW1; Ct. Narender Singh, the police witness of investigation, as PW2;
Mr.Ajay, the brother of the deceased and who identified the body of deceased, as PW3; Mr.
Dharamvir, the uncle of deceased, who also identified the her body, as PW4; Ms.Aarti, sister of deceased and the complainant of the case, as PW5; Ms.Somwati, mother of deceased, as PW6;
Mr.Joginder Singh, Tehsildar cum Executive Magistrate who conducted the inquest proceedings, as PW7; Retd. SI Om Parkash, the Sessions Case Number: 103 of 2009.

